+      FIELD | DUMP | HAS_HEAP_DUMPS | HAS_ALLOCATOR_HEAP_DUMP,
+      FIELD | DUMP | HAS_HEAP_DUMPS | HAS_ALLOCATOR_HEAP_DUMP,
+      FIELD | DUMP | HAS_HEAP_DUMPS | HAS_ALLOCATOR_HEAP_DUMP
