+      '       Binder_1-217   [001] d..3 12622.507253: sched_switch: prev_comm=Binder_1 prev_pid=217 prev_prio=120 prev_state=S ==> next_comm=Android.launcher next_pid=584 next_prio=120' // @suppress longLineCheck
